Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_EXT_DISCOUNT_AMT,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_YEAR 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_QOY <= 2 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_EXT_SHIP_COST >= +12544.30


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.WS_EXT_DISCOUNT_AMT AS "WS_EXT_DISCOUNT_AMT",
  Q2.D_YEAR AS "D_YEAR" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (+12544.30 <= Q1.WS_EXT_SHIP_COST) AND 
  (Q2.D_QOY <= 2)

Explain level:    Explain from section

